    Name:"Projekte\\KundenauftrÃ¤ge\\Weightworks\\Laserteile\\Deckel-gelasert\\15.12.15\\LB1180_4\\179.jpg", 
    Flags:0x1a4, 
    Modified:1450212405, 
    Version:protocol.Vector{
        protocol.Counter{ID:MC5WCAZ, Value:0x1}, 
        protocol.Counter{ID:TAQLGAQ, Value:0x1}
    }, 
    LocalVersion:162217, 
    CachedSize:0
} 
```

and suddenly it receives the following file (potentially from TAQLGAQ)

```
protocol.FileInfo{
    Name:"Projekte\\KundenauftrÃ¤ge\\Weightworks\\Laserteile\\Deckel-gelasert\\15.12.15\\LB1180_4\\179.jpg", 
    Flags:0x1a4, 
    Modified:1450212627, 
    Version:protocol.Vector{
        protocol.Counter{ID:TAQLGAQ, Value:0x2}
    }, 
